Your body is more like that of an ooze.

When you take damage, you may split and create a Bloated Ooze nearby within your line of sight.

This ooze has as much health as twice the damage you took, up to a maximum of (50 + {{ctmd|30|250}} + {{ctl|25%|3.5|12.5%}} * Player Max Life).
----
'''''Warning''': The split chance does not work exactly as advertised in this talent's description.

* If the damage taken is less than 1/3 of current health, then the chance to split equals the percent of your health lost times {{cl|{{ctstd|Cun|10|400}}|100|0.6|0|1.83|234}}. This is the value displayed in the talent's description.
* If the damage taken is is more than 1/3 of your current life, then the chance to split equals {{cl|{{ctstd|Cun|10|400}}|100%|20|0|61%|234}}. This is exactly 1/3 of the split chance multiplier seen in the talent's description.
----
You may have up to {{ctl|6|1.1|4.1}} Bloated Oozes active at any time, up to your [[Cunning|summoning limit]], and all damage you take will be split equally between you and them so long as this talent is active.

Bloated Oozes last for {{cts|6|10}} turns, are very resilient with {{ctl|70%|15|35%}} all damage resistance to damage not coming through your shared link, and regenerate life quickly.

The chance to split increases with your Cunning.
